diting-firmware-setup (0.1.2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * CN ROM compatibility: persist/audio (factory speaker calibration)
    is optional now. CN persist, and any persist reflashed from a
    fastboot ROM image, has none; diting-speaker-protection then stays
    on the plain ASP path instead of the build failing.
  * Camera modules: also convert the Samsung S5KHM6 wide module of CN
    units (no mainline driver yet; the camregs is ready for when one
    lands).

